# Terms the rendering tests place in queries: Alice, whom she knows, and the
# named graph the patterns look in.
@prefix sd: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sparql-service-description#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix foaf: <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .

ex:alice foaf:knows ex:a .
[] a sd:GraphCollection ; sd:namedGraph [ sd:name ex:graph ] .
